1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,999
Thank you so much to the Blessed Mother and Jesus for making me and my family witnesses to the apparition of the Blessed Mother.

2
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,999
My name is Chippy Joyce. I am a parishioner of St. Sebastian's Forane Church, Thodupuzha.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,999
I took my first Covenant on December 14, 2024. It was my mummy who encouraged me to do it.

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:40,999
My husband and I came here and took the Covenant together. From the very moment we took it, the Blessed Mother has been with us.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:49,999
I started experiencing many signs that she had come into our home, right from the time our vehicle was moving.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:57,999
We were deep in prayer. We went home and remained in prayer. We were given sufferings to bear. Every single day, I prayed with tears in my eyes.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,999
I prayed, "Mother, you are still giving me sufferings, aren't you?"

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,999
While things were like this, in the month of March, my husband's and—I have two children—

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,999
my second son's birthdays fall in the exact same month,

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,999
March 6th and March 8th. It was during this time, on the eve of my husband's birthday,

11
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:31,999
around midnight, my mind and body became incredibly restless. My spirit kept telling me that someone had entered this house.

12
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:38,999
But I couldn't see anyone. I couldn't sleep. My children were at our family home, my husband's ancestral home.

13
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:46,999
Only my husband and I were there. Around 12 o'clock, when I sat up in my bed and looked, right behind me,

14
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,999
This Mother was standing there. She came and stood near our bedroom. That much I know for certain. After that, I lay down and went back to sleep.

15
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:04,999
In the morning, my husband went to work. I had told the Mother, "Mother, please wake me up at 5:30," because I didn't have a phone with me back then.

16
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,999
I had to rely on looking at the clock to wake up. I begged the Mother, "You must wake me up at 5:30.

17
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:19,999
I need to do my prayers." I lay down. When it was about ten minutes to 5:30, a voice called out, "Hey Chippy,"

18
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:26,999
sounding exactly like my mummy calling me. I jolted awake, still groggy from sleep. I suddenly got up and looked around.

19
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:34,999
Was it my mummy? No, my mummy wasn't here. My hometown is Erumely, so it wasn't my mummy. Then I realized, it was the Blessed Mother!

20
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:41,999
The Mother came to me with my mummy's voice. When I looked at the time, it was exactly ten minutes to 5:30. I got up,

21
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:48,999
and as I lit the candle to begin my prayers, the Mother told me, "Open the door, open the door."

22
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:55,999
She kept saying it. When I opened the door, there was an overwhelming, powerful fragrance of jasmine. I don't have a single plant in my house.

23
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:04,999
Even if there were a jasmine plant, it wouldn't be blooming; there are no flowers around. But there was a strong scent of jasmine. I searched the entire porch,

24
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:13,999
but there was no jasmine to be found. Where was this beautiful fragrance coming from? That's when I suddenly remembered Father Joseph's teaching,

25
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:20,999
that when the Blessed Mother comes, you will experience the sweet fragrance of jasmine. I immediately ran back to the Mother and asked,

26
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:27,999
"Mother, did you come to my home?" That was all I asked. At that exact moment, the fragrance vanished. After that, I started my prayers.

27
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:36,999
My husband initially had a very small job. He was working in the Milma milk field.

28
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:44,999
Since the age of 18, the milk field has been the work he finds easiest and loves the most.

29
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:51,999
So when I first made the Covenant, my very first intercession was, "Mother, please grant my husband a job in that field."

30
00:03:52,000 --> 00:04:00,999
Exactly one week after taking the Covenant and praying for this, my husband's friend called and offered him a job as a driver in that very same milk field.

31
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:08,999
That was the very first blessing the Mother granted us. Then we continued our prayers fervently. We kept praying, and one day during prayer,

32
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:14,999
the Mother appeared to me in the very form of this statue, glowing within the green candle.

33
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:22,999
Even then, the Mother told me, "I am with you. Do not be afraid. No matter what comes your way, you must not shed a tear."

34
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:29,999
In my heart, I responded, "I am praying in the best way I know how. I am joyfully accepting all the sufferings you are sending me."

35
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:37,999
While things were like this, last October, the hemoglobin (HB) level in my blood dropped drastically. Everyone normally needs an HB of 12 to 13,

36
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:44,999
but mine was steadily dropping to 9 and 8. It was a time of continuous physical decline, but I held firmly onto my prayers.

37
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:51,999
I was completely exhausted. We were running so many medical tests. And all those tests were costing four thousands of rupees. So, I would tell the Mother,

38
00:04:52,000 --> 00:05:00,999
"Mother, my husband has to manage all of this completely on his own. Whatever suffering you give me, I will accept it with both hands, but please do not burden my husband."

39
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:08,999
We did the final medical test, and when the results came out, we forwarded them to a cousin sister of ours.

40
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:14,999
When she saw the results, she said, "This is quite critical, Chippy. You must immediately either go to the Medical College,

41
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,999
or to a nearby private hospital." But if we went to a private hospital,

42
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:26,999
a single blood injection would cost over four thousand rupees. We simply couldn't afford that.

43
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:32,999
So, my husband and I made a firm decision. My husband got a bit scared and said, "You should go to the Medical College.

44
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:40,999
Let's get tested there, whatever happens, let it happen." I cried and prayed to the Blessed Mother, "Mother,

45
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:47,999
you are the one who must go before me, no one else. We have no one but you, Mother," I pleaded with her.

46
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:55,999
The day before we were to go to the Medical College, we got all the tests done at a nearby hospital. Carrying those results and preparing for the Medical College,

47
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:03,999
On the way, we saw a woman who looked exactly like the statue of the Blessed Mother. She had the exact same height,

48
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:10,999
a covering over her head, and she was carrying a small child. When this woman saw us approaching, she was smiling beautifully.

49
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:19,999
She looked like someone begging for alms. But she was smiling brightly. There was no sorrow on her face, only a divine smile.

50
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:26,999
My husband and I were riding our bike. We smiled back. As we moved a little forward, my husband himself suggested it.

51
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:34,999
We had bought some snacks for our kids and were holding ice cream in our hands.

52
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:40,999
My husband said, "Hey, didn't you see that woman and her child walking by? Let's give an ice cream to that little child."

53
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:47,999
Before this happened, during the time my blood levels were dropping, both of my hands had developed severe white patches.

54
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:56,999
These white patches were terrible; anyone who saw them would be deeply concerned. Because of these patches, both my hands would itch uncontrollably.

55
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:04,999
Whenever sunlight hit them, they would itch, crack open, and bleed. I couldn't bear the pain; it was that difficult.

56
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:13,999
I was going about my life bearing this terrible condition. Seeing this woman, we turned our bike around to offer an ice cream to the child.

57
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:18,999
As we did, the woman and the child turned towards us,

58
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:25,999
smiling continuously. I thought to myself, "What is this? People who come begging for alms usually don't smile like this, do they?

59
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:34,999
They usually ask with sorrow, not a smile." Looking at that woman's smile, I could instantly feel a great divine presence radiating from her.

60
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:46,999
I stepped down from the bike, and the moment I did, the woman gently rubbed her hand down my arm and shoulder. At that exact second, a powerful shock like lightning coursed through my hand!

61
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:53,999
I couldn't understand anything. I wondered, "Why did she suddenly come and touch my hand?" Usually, beggars keep a distance,

62
00:07:54,000 --> 00:08:00,999
don't they? But she came right up to me and touched me. And the little child was gazing intently into my eyes. The color of the clothes

63
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:10,999
the child was wearing was the exact deep blue color of the candle we light during our 5:30 AM prayers! The child just kept staring at me.

64
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:18,999
I handed over the ice cream. Then I asked my husband, "Do you have any money on you?" She mentioned they hadn't received anything that day.

65
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:25,999
My husband took some money and gave it to her, and showed them the way. We got back on the bike, and until we rode completely out of sight,

66
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:30,999
the child kept turning back and staring right at me. By the time evening fell, I called everyone and joyfully declared,

67
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:39,999
"The Blessed Mother and Jesus came to see me!" I told my husband, and I testified to my whole family, "The Blessed Mother came to visit me.

68
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:48,999
I am absolutely certain that my illness will be cured." The very next day, we were on our way to the Medical College. My eldest daughter and I boarded a bus.

69
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:58,999
The bus was fully packed; there was no place to sit at all. While I was standing there tightly holding my child's hand, right opposite to me sat a woman.

70
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:06,999
She was wearing a white dress with green floral patterns. At first, I didn't pay much attention.

71
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:12,999
But this woman gently pulled my child into a warm embrace. She hugged her and told me, "Dear, I am traveling up to Kottayam.

72
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:20,999
Let the child sit comfortably on my lap." She seated my little girl on her lap, rested her head, and put her to sleep.

73
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:28,999
I was holding my Holy Rosary tight in my hand at that moment. I was interceding fervently, "Mother, please go before me and take care of everything."

74
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:35,999
We sat in the bus and finally reached Kottayam. The woman got down. As she was leaving, she simply said, "I am going now." That was all she said.

75
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:44,999
I smiled, and that sister also smiled. As soon as we reached the hospital, there was no rush. Very quickly, I was able to see the doctors.

76
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:56,999
At that time, I didn't feel any exhaustion at all. The doctor was a lady doctor wearing a silver-grey churidar.

77
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:03,999
When she spoke to me, I wasn't really paying attention, but that doctor told me,

78
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:14,999
"Dear child, you only need to do these tests when you have the money. For now, just take this medicine." So I remembered,

79
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:26,999
there were 18 tests to be done. 18 tests would cost nearly six thousand rupees! So I said, "Alright, doctor, I will do that."

80
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:32,999
Everyone knows that medicines prescribed at Kottayam Medical College are only available in the nearby medical stores.

81
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:38,999
But that day, I didn't even buy that medicine. I went home without buying it.

82
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:48,999
I didn't take any medicine either. Up until this very moment, that illness has never returned! I don't know what happened, but from the moment that Mother, that sister,

83
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:58,999
came near me, my illness was completely cured. Later, the Blessed Mother appeared to me in the form of a dove.

84
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:07,999
When my child had a fever, I was on my way to a nearby government hospital. At that time, I told the Blessed Mother—whenever I go anywhere,

85
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:15,999
I say, "Mother, you must go before me and take care of everything. Only then will I come.

86
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:23,999
I don't have the strength to do it myself, so you must go." Wherever I go, I always pray the Holy Rosary along the way.

87
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:31,999
I asked the Mother, "Mother, I need to know if you are truly with me. You must give me a sign."

88
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:42,999
As I was walking forward, continuously praying the Holy Rosary, after about half an hour of walking, a dove in the Mother's colors—silver grey—came right in front of me.

89
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:49,999
The dove looked right at me, and then gracefully soared up into the sky.

90
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:57,999
In that moment, the only thought that echoed in my heart was her word: "I am with you, do not be afraid, keep walking forward."

91
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:05,999
Just like that, she appeared as a flower in the candle flame, and she blessed me with the sweet fragrance of jasmine.

92
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:13,999
The Mother came to me in so many different ways. My husband got a job! Not only that, before taking this Covenant,

93
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:23,999
we had asked many people for help because my husband had met with an accident and was jobless at the time.

94
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:34,999
Those who rejected us then, who told us "no," are now calling me and saying, "Chippy, please intercede for my children.

95
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:40,999
My child is going for a job," or "My child is going for an exam, please pray."

96
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:49,999
They are now asking us for help! The one thing I firmly believe now is that it wasn't by my ability or my husband's ability,

97
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:58,999
but purely by the grace of the Blessed Mother that we have been guided forward. Now, the acts of mercy I do are..

98
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:05,999
Only my husband is working. But whether it is my husband or me,

99
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:10,999
we try to help others financially in whatever small way we can.

100
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:18,999
We also provide food for those who come asking for it, and we give clothes to those who have none.

101
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:24,999
We offer various kinds of help, mostly supporting people financially whenever we can.

102
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:31,999
In many matters, the Mother does not allow the word "no" to come out of our mouths when people ask us. She just tells us,

103
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:39,999
"Buy it and give it to them." Not only that, as part of my apostolic work, I distribute the newsletters. Also,

104
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:48,999
in every way possible, I tell everyone about the Blessed Mother. I tell them, "Come and take the Covenant, the Blessed Mother will draw near to you."

105
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:57,999
I explain all this to them. On my WhatsApp status, and every day at exactly 5:48 AM, right after my 5:30 AM prayer time,

106
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:05,999
I send messages to everyone in my contacts. I share my prayers and the retreats preached by the priests. Everyone tells me,

107
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:14,999
"When we open WhatsApp, Chippy's message is the very first one we see."

108
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:19,999
That's because from 2024 to 2026,

109
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:24,999
up to this very moment, every single message the Mother gives me,

110
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:29,999
I send it to everyone I know. I regularly attend Holy Mass every Sunday.

111
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:36,999
I also go for Confession once a month. Then there's our prayer—we have family prayer every single day.

112
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:44,999
My husband, my children, and I join together for family prayer daily. Then, at 5:30 in the morning, only my children and I usually wake up to pray.

113
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:50,999
My husband leaves for work very early at dawn, but he is a person who deeply participates in all our prayers.

114
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:55,999
Thanking the Blessed Mother once again for giving me everything, I conclude my testimony.

115
00:14:56,000 --> 00:15:03,999
"Fear not, for I am with you, be not dismayed, for I am your God; I will strengthen you,

116
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:13,999
I will help you, I will uphold you with my victorious right hand." This is from the Book of the Prophet Isaiah,

117
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:21,999
Chapter 41, Verse 10. No matter what our life circumstances are,

118
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:29,999
no matter how difficult they get, there is no need to fear. "Be not dismayed, for I am with you"

119
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:35,999
this is the promise of God in the lives of the Covenant children.

120
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:40,999
God is our Savior and our Protector.

121
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:48,999
Therefore, we do not need to be anxious. When our strength is limited, when we feel we have no power,

122
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:59,999
when we feel there is no one by our side, through the Covenant path, we receive a new strength, a new spiritual courage.

123
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,999
We receive the strength to face our problems, and we can clearly understand every testimony of God actively intervening in our lives.

124
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:14,999
It is the mighty hands of God that lead us forward is what we hear in these testimonies,

125
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:20,999
What we just heard in Chippy Joyce's testimony, is exactly that. It is a great testimony of divine experience,

126
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:29,999
where Chippy Joyce shared with us how she deeply and intimately experienced the presence of God and the Blessed Mother.

127
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:38,999
Today, we, the children of the Covenant, are different from all other people on the face of the earth, because that very presence of God is with us.

128
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:44,999
It is the divine presence we receive through the Covenant that sets us apart from all others.

129
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:51,999
The Covenant makes us God's own people. "If I have found favor in your sight,

130
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:57,999
show me now your ways, that I may know you and find favor in your sight."

131
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:06,999
This is what the Book of Exodus, Chapter 33, Verse 13 says. We are exactly like that. The children of the Covenant are the people who listen to the Word of God;

132
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:11,999
they are God's own people. When we pray, "Show me your ways,"

133
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:17,999
Jesus and the Blessed Mother stand with us and open up new paths for us.

134
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:28,999
Our goal is not just to receive blessings, but to know God more and to love Him more. It is perhaps for blessings that we initially come to Mother of Kreupasanam,

135
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:35,999
but later, slowly and gradually, we move from blessings to the Anointing.

136
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:41,999
When we experience that divine presence intimately, we desire to stay close to God and to live in His grace.

137
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:47,999
The Blessed Mother and the Kreupasanam Covenant are a pathway to remain in that grace.

138
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,999
The Blessed Mother helps us to know the ways of God and to remain in His divine grace.

139
00:17:55,000 --> 00:18:00,999
Let us pray that the Blessed Mother helps us to grow in that grace and to know Jesus more deeply.

140
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:09,999
Let us clap our hands and glorify God for all the blessings Chippy Joyce's family has received! Thank You, Jesus! Praise You, Jesus! Ave Maria!

141
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:21,999
Extraordinary experiences of God can now be yours. If you haven't subscribed to this YouTube channel yet, please subscribe right now.

142
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:26,000
Share this video with your friends right now, and become a missionary for the Lord.
